*:Zone.Identifier
*:WPSSyncID
~$*

# Paper reports keep readable analysis; frozen execution payloads live in experiment artifacts/runs.
/paper/my_paper/analysis/**/bundles/
/paper/my_paper/analysis/**/runs/*/raw/
/paper/my_paper/analysis/**/runs/*/accepted/
/paper/my_paper/analysis/**/runs/*/deployment.tar.gz
/paper/my_paper/analysis/20261108_autotvm_diverse_top20/raw/
/paper/my_paper/analysis/20261108_autotvm_diverse_top20/accepted/
# Superseded slide editing backups; editable final SVGs and exports remain visible.
